<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson, Lockeed Martin in AWAC pact.</title>
<headline>Ericsson, Lockeed Martin in AWAC pact.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms and information technology group LM Ericsson AB said on Monday it had joined forces with U.S. aviation group Lockheed Martin to offer advanced Airborne Early Warning and Control (AWAC) systems.</p>
</text>
